<title>UK: Wet Brent cargo trades firmer at August - 3 cts.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent cargo trades firmer at August - 3 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Dated Brent cargo traded at August Brent minus three cents on Wednesday, nine cents firmer than two deals done on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The July 27-29 cargo changed hands between two trading houses.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
